cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "mtb-resistotyper-ml: a runner for versioned M. tuberculosis resistance models"
abstract: >-
  Command-line runner that scores Mycobacterium tuberculosis drug-resistance model
  bundles which declare their own operating range. The models are distributed
  separately and joined to the runner only by the artefact contract. A web
  application built on the same package ingests VCFs, consults the WHO catalogue
  first, and reports model calls with their reliability band.
authors:
